      "title": "Welcome email sent on every save",
      "description": "The after_save callback runs on create and on every update. The new update action and any other save trigger it again. Users receive a new welcome email each time an admin or the code updates their record. The job may also run before the transaction commits. Use after_create_commit so the email goes out once, after the record is committed.",
      "suggested_change": "  after_create_commit :send_welcome_email",
      "source": null,
